	<h2>For under-18 learners</h2>
	<ul><li>A guardian link and consent record before any booking.</li><li>Adults cannot message a minor directly. Every thread with a minor includes the guardian and is retained.</li><li>Sessions with minors are audio-recorded and kept for 30 days. Guardians can review them.</li><li>No contact details are shared. Phone numbers and emails in messages are blocked and reported.</li><li>Only tutors with a clean safeguarding check and an <strong>approved-for-minors</strong> badge can teach under-18s.</li><li>Under-18s never earn cash. They earn Hive Credits — free subscription days — for referrals and streaks.</li></ul>
	<h2>For guardians</h2>
	<ul><li>See readiness, practice hours and sessions for each child.</li><li>Set a spending limit; anything above it needs your approval.</li><li>Approve or decline cohort places and bookings from one screen.</li></ul>
